            ],
            "ctaSubtitle": "Get started in minutes. Install the package, configure your blocks, and start editing visually.",
            "ctaTitle": "Ready to try Conloca?",
            "differentiatorSubtitle": "What makes Conloca different from traditional headless CMS platforms",
            "differentiatorTitle": "Key Differentiators",
            "differentiators": [
              {
                "description": "Your content lives in your git repository as plain files. If you stop using Conloca, your content stays exactly where it is. There is no data migration, no export step, and no API to replace. You own your content from day one.",
                "id": "diff-1",
                "title": "No vendor lock-in"
              },
              {
                "description": "Conloca is not a generic CMS bolted onto Astro through a plugin. It is built from the ground up for Astro, using Astro middleware, Astro routing, and Astro build pipelines. This native integration means fewer moving parts and a tighter developer experience.",
                "id": "diff-2",
                "title": "Built for Astro"
              },
              {
                "description": "Marketers and content editors use a visual drag-and-drop editor to build pages. Developers define the components, control the styling, and maintain full ownership of the codebase. Both roles work in the same repository without stepping on each other.",
                "id": "diff-3",
                "title": "Visual + Developer"
              },
              {
                "description": "No database server, no external API, no cloud dependency. Conloca runs as part of your Astro site on Bun or Node.js. Deploy it on a VPS, in a Docker container, or behind a Cloudflare Tunnel. The entire CMS is self-contained.",
                "id": "diff-4",
                "title": "Zero infrastructure"
              }
            ],
            "extendedSubtitle": "Conloca is a CMS purpose-built to combine file-based git storage, native Astro integration, and visual drag-and-drop editing in a single free, open-source package. Unlike cloud-hosted options like Storyblok and Contentful, Conloca requires no external API, no database, and no monthly subscription.",
            "highlightColumnIndex": 0,
            "id": "ComparisonTable-q7r8s9t0",
